 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Once upon a time,",
   "s": 0.202,
   "e": 1.203
  },
  {
   "text": "in a small Indian village,",
   "s": 1.411,
   "e": 2.567
  },
  {
   "text": "six blind men lived together.",
   "s": 2.881,
   "e": 4.396
  },
  {
   "text": "One day,",
   "s": 5.08,
   "e": 5.607
  },
  {
   "text": "they heard that a royal elephant had arrived at the village temple.",
   "s": 5.884,
   "e": 9.023
  },
  {
   "text": "Curious to discover what an elephant looked like,",
   "s": 9.761,
   "e": 12.025
  },
  {
   "text": "they went to see it.",
   "s": 12.248,
   "e": 13.082
  },
  {
   "text": "The first man touched its huge side and exclaimed,",
   "s": 13.773,
   "e": 16.358
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cAn elephant is just like a giant wall!\u201d",
   "s": 16.644,
   "e": 18.603
  },
  {
   "text": "The second touched its sharp tusk and said,",
   "s": 19.343,
   "e": 21.577
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cNo!",
   "s": 21.718,
   "e": 21.933
  },
  {
   "text": "It is like a spear!\u201d",
   "s": 22.631,
   "e": 23.503
  },
  {
   "text": "The third held its long,",
   "s": 24.205,
   "e": 25.426
  },
  {
   "text": "twisting trunk and shouted,",
   "s": 25.637,
   "e": 26.881
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cYou are all wrong!",
   "s": 27.091,
   "e": 27.895
  },
  {
   "text": "It is just like a snake!\u201d",
   "s": 28.629,
   "e": 29.828
  },
  {
   "text": "The fourth felt its strong leg and said,",
   "s": 31.0,
   "e": 33.068
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cSurely,",
   "s": 33.317,
   "e": 33.681
  },
  {
   "text": "an elephant is like a tree!\u201d",
   "s": 33.894,
   "e": 35.207
  },
  {
   "text": "The fifth touched its large ear and declared,",
   "s": 35.906,
   "e": 38.24
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cIt is clearly like a hand fan!\u201d",
   "s": 38.529,
   "e": 39.882
  },
  {
   "text": "Finally,",
   "s": 40.627,
   "e": 41.039
  },
  {
   "text": "the sixth held its swinging tail and laughed,",
   "s": 41.246,
   "e": 43.313
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cHow can you not see?",
   "s": 43.549,
   "e": 44.418
  },
  {
   "text": "It is just like a rope!\u201d",
   "s": 45.126,
   "e": 46.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon,",
   "s": 46.964,
   "e": 47.265
  },
  {
   "text": "the six men began arguing loudly,",
   "s": 47.596,
   "e": 49.448
  },
  {
   "text": "each believing he was right.",
   "s": 49.74,
   "e": 50.944
  },
  {
   "text": "A wise old villager passing by smiled and said,",
   "s": 51.748,
   "e": 54.239
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cYou are all partly right,",
   "s": 54.57,
   "e": 55.763
  },
  {
   "text": "but none of you understands the whole elephant.",
   "s": 56.016,
   "e": 58.09
  },
  {
   "text": "You have each felt only one part!\u201d",
   "s": 58.825,
   "e": 60.694
  },
  {
   "text": "The six men fell silent,",
   "s": 61.844,
   "e": 63.074
  },
  {
   "text": "realising their mistake.",
   "s": 63.319,
   "e": 64.361
  },
  {
   "text": "Moral:",
   "s": 65.166,
   "e": 65.479
  },
  {
   "text": "We should never judge the whole picture from just one perspective.",
   "s": 65.719,
   "e": 68.73
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes,",
   "s": 69.461,
   "e": 69.976
  },
  {
   "text": "everyone has a little piece of the truth!",
   "s": 70.118,
   "e": 72.139
  }
 ]
}